<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">ImCoref-CeS: An <span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">Im</span>proved Lightweight Pipeline for <span id="id2" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">Coref</span>erence Resolution with LLM-based <span id="id3" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">C</span>heck<span id="id4" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">e</span>r-<span id="id5" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">S</span>plitter Refinement</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
