The cluster combines mentions of the government (e.g., #1, #3, #6) and the four S&amp;Ls (e.g., #2, #4, #5, #7, #8). Pronouns like “its” (#3) and “the four big thrifts” (#5) clearly refer to the government and the S&amp;Ls respectively. These are distinct entities. No.</span>
